---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (Legion: Incident Response Plan)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_init: incident confirmed, frontend paused
    q_init --> q_enumerate: enumerate all active sale contracts
    q_enumerate --> q_iter: for each active sale contract
    q_iter --> q_withdraw: call emergencyWithdraw(contract)
    q_withdraw --> q_verify: verify funds transferred
    q_verify --> q_iter: more contracts remaining
    q_verify --> q_complete: all contracts processed
    q_complete --> [*]: all funds secured

    note right of q_iter
        INV-001: Every active sale contract must be processed
        INV-002: No contract may be skipped during emergency withdrawal
    end note

    note right of q_verify
        INV-003: Fund balance after withdrawal must match expected amount
    end note
